>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">子息</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">しそく</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">（他人的）儿子；令郎</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"217155\">ご<ruby>子息<rp>(</rp><rt>しそく</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>のご<ruby>結婚<rp>(</rp><rt>けっこん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>心<rp>(</rp><rt>こころ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>よりお<ruby>祝<rp>(</rp><rt>いわ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>い<ruby>申<rp>(</rp><rt>もう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>し<ruby>上<rp>(</rp><rt>あ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>げます。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">谨为另公子婚事献上由衷祝福。 <a class=\"ex-attribution\" href=\"https://tatoeba.org/sentences/show/13359649\" title=\"Tatoeba · tengooi\" aria-label=\"Tatoeba · tengooi\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">↗</a></span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">子孫</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">しそん</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../n2/vocab/\">N2</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">后代；子孙；后裔</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"168394\"><ruby>子孫<rp>(</rp><rt>しそん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>にきれいな、<ruby>緑<rp>(</rp><rt>みどり</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の<ruby>地球<rp>(</rp><rt>ちきゅう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>残<rp>(</rp><rt>のこ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>したい。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">我想留下一个美丽的绿色地球给我的后裔。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">下</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">した</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n5\" href=\"../n5/kanji/\">N5</a><span class=\"v-m\">下面</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span class=\"lx-src\"><span class=\"t-zh\">汉字 </span